1. SINGLETON PATTERN - When you absolutely need a instance that will accessible globally like a database connection pool
   or a logger

------ Trade-Offs --------
@ Advantage
Guarenteed Single instance - (prevent multiple copies of resourse/state)
Global Access Point - (easy to use anywhere in application) (Need Thread-safe implementation)

@ Disadvantag
Threading Issues - (Race condition during instance creation)
Testing Difficulties - (Can't create easily mock for unit tests - complex test setup)

